WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:05.100
A fast train runs along a straight,
level track at a constant speed.

2
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:06.220
Not speeding up.

3
00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.860
Not slowing down.

4
00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.530
Inside, you stand in the aisle
and throw a ball forward,

5
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:13.780
at a third of the train's speed.

6
00:00:13.830 --> 00:00:18.110
The ball flies forward along the aisle,
while the whole train keeps moving past

7
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.240
the scenery.

8
00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:21.860
So how fast is the ball moving?

9
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:23.260
The speed of your throw?

10
00:00:23.310 --> 00:00:24.510
Something else?

11
00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:27.880
In this mission, you'll add
velocities along a straight line,

12
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:29.860
giving each one a sign.

13
00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:34.310
Then you'll test whether a falling ball's
acceleration changes when the observer

14
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.620
is moving.

15
00:00:35.670 --> 00:00:39.550
Your mission: decide how fast
the thrown ball is moving.
